{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-tree-refund-return-compensate","title":"退款/退货/补偿/打款决定树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/evidence-adjudication/decision-tree-refund-return-compensate","wordCount":2187,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"退款-退货-补偿-打款决定树\">退款/退货/补偿/打款决定树</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>裁决的最终产物不是一段评述，而是一个<strong>动作</strong>：给谁、给多少、以什么条件给。把所有可能的动作收敛起来，只有四条出口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>REFUND_FULL 全额退款</strong>：钱回买家，货不必回（或无货可回）。</li>\n<li><strong>RETURN_REFUND 退货退款</strong>：买家先退回，验收后卖家退款。</li>\n<li><strong>PARTIAL_COMPENSATE 部分补偿</strong>：买家保留货，卖家退一部分钱。</li>\n<li><strong>PAY_SELLER 打款卖家</strong>：驳回买家主张，资金结算给卖家。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>决定树的任务是把&quot;证据认定 + 争议类型 + 金额&quot;映射到这四条出口之一。它的价值不在于判得比人更准，而在于<strong>同样的输入必须得到同样的输出</strong>——这是可申诉、可质检、可自动化的前提。一棵好的决定树是可被印在文档里、由非裁决人员复现的规则图，而不是藏在某位资深客服脑子里的经验。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[事实认定结果] --&gt; B{主张是否成立?}&#10;  B --&gt;|不成立| P[PAY_SELLER]&#10;  B --&gt;|成立| C{货物是否可退回&lt;br/&gt;且价值 &gt; 退货成本?}&#10;  C --&gt;|否| D{买家是否实际受损?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| R[RETURN_REFUND]&#10;  D --&gt;|全部受损| E[REFUND_FULL]&#10;  D --&gt;|部分受损| F[PARTIAL_COMPENSATE]&#10;  D --&gt;|未受损| P&#10;  R --&gt; G{卖家是否逾期&lt;br/&gt;验收或退款?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| E&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[结案]&#10;  E --&gt; I[资金动作:平台先行赔付?]&#10;  F --&gt; I&#10;  P --&gt; J[资金动作:结算释放]&#10;  I --&gt; K{卖家是否承担?}&#10;  K --&gt;|是| L[向卖家追偿/保证金扣划]&#10;  K --&gt;|否| M[平台承担]\">flowchart TD\n  A[事实认定结果] --&gt; B{主张是否成立?}\n  B --&gt;|不成立| P[PAY_SELLER]\n  B --&gt;|成立| C{货物是否可退回&lt;br/&gt;且价值 &gt; 退货成本?}\n  C --&gt;|否| D{买家是否实际受损?}\n  C --&gt;|是| R[RETURN_REFUND]\n  D --&gt;|全部受损| E[REFUND_FULL]\n  D --&gt;|部分受损| F[PARTIAL_COMPENSATE]\n  D --&gt;|未受损| P\n  R --&gt; G{卖家是否逾期&lt;br/&gt;验收或退款?}\n  G --&gt;|是| E\n  G --&gt;|否| H[结案]\n  E --&gt; I[资金动作:平台先行赔付?]\n  F --&gt; I\n  P --&gt; J[资金动作:结算释放]\n  I --&gt; K{卖家是否承担?}\n  K --&gt;|是| L[向卖家追偿/保证金扣划]\n  K --&gt;|否| M[平台承担]</pre><h2 id=\"四条出口的触发条件\">四条出口的触发条件</h2><h3 id=\"refund_full-货不可回或回不划算\">REFUND_FULL：货不可回或回不划算</h3><p>触发条件通常是三者之一：<strong>货已丢失或损坏到不可用</strong>、<strong>退回的物流成本超过货值</strong>、或者<strong>卖家逾期未处理退货</strong>（买家已按流程退回但卖家未验收或未退款）。第三种是最常见的——它把卖家的不作为转化为对买家的全额赔付。</p>\n<p>跨境场景下&quot;回不划算&quot;的门槛很低：一件 15 美元的商品从欧洲退回亚洲的运费可能就超过 15 美元。因此低值跨境商品默认走 REFUND_FULL 而非 RETURN_REFUND，这是纯粹的经济学判断，与谁对谁错无关。</p>\n<h3 id=\"return_refund-货有价值且可回\">RETURN_REFUND：货有价值且可回</h3><p>适用条件是货值显著高于逆向物流成本，且买家主张成立。这条出口的工程复杂度最高，因为它引入了一个<strong>跨系统的状态机</strong>：退货单创建 → 面单下发 → 买家寄出 → 承运商揽收 → 跨境运输 → 入仓验收 → 质检判定 → 退款执行。任何一步失败都会导致案件重新打开。</p>\n<p>设计要点是<strong>把退款触发点绑定到&quot;验收通过&quot;而非&quot;买家声称已寄出&quot;</strong>。eBay 的规则提供了一个可参考的口径：卖家须在收到退货商品后 <strong>2 个工作日</strong>内退款（<a href=\"https://www.ebay.com/help/buying/returns-refunds/ebay-money-back-guarantee-policy?id=4210\">eBay Money Back Guarantee policy</a>）。把这类期限写进决定树，让它成为可自动执行的超时动作，而不是需要人记得的规则。</p>\n<h3 id=\"partial_compensate-双方都不全对\">PARTIAL_COMPENSATE：双方都不全对</h3><p>这条出口最容易被误用，因为它看起来像&quot;和稀泥&quot;。它成立的正当理由只有一种：<strong>买家的损失是可量化的部分损失，且退货不经济</strong>。典型场景是商品功能正常但有外观瑕疵，买家愿意留着用但要求折价；或商品缺件，补齐的成本（跨境再发一次）高于缺件本身的价值。</p>\n<p>它不该用于&quot;证据不足时给点钱息事宁人&quot;。这种做法会把决定树变成一台可被套利的机器——买家只要主张得足够模糊，就能稳定获得补偿。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pay_seller-主张不成立\">PAY_SELLER：主张不成立</h3><p>包括三种情况：证据表明卖家已履约（有效签收凭证、商品与描述一致）、买家未能达到初步证明标准、或者买家主张属于政策例外且无合理依据。打款不是&quot;惩罚买家&quot;，而是资金结算的正常路径——它的措辞在面向买家的通知里应当是解释性的，不是裁决性的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决定树中的金额计算\">决定树中的金额计算</h2><h3 id=\"部分补偿的量化\">部分补偿的量化</h3><p>部分补偿的金额应当由<strong>可观测的损失项</strong>推导，而不是拍脑袋的百分比。一个可落地的口径：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\min\\left( P \\cdot d,\\; P - \\max(F_{return},\\, V_{salvage}) \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 为实付金额，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为经证据认定的损失比例（如缺件按缺件部分的价值占比），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{return}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为退货的逆向物流成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{salvage}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为残值。右半部分的作用是<strong>给补偿设一个上限</strong>：补偿不应超过&quot;若走退货路径卖家的实际损失&quot;，否则买家会选择总是要求补偿。</p>\n<p>损失比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 必须来自证据，不能来自双方的主张。例如&quot;商品页标注含 3 件配件，实物只有 2 件&quot;，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为缺失配件价值占商品总价值的比例——这是一个可由商品页快照与实物照片核对出的数，而&quot;我觉得值一半&quot;不是。</p>\n<h3 id=\"货币与汇率的口径\">货币与汇率的口径</h3><p>跨境案件的一个隐藏陷阱是<strong>币种不一致</strong>：买家以 A 币种付款、卖家以 B 币种结算、平台可能以 C 币种记账。金额比较（如&quot;是否低于自动裁决上限&quot;）必须在一个统一口径下进行，否则阈值判断会漂移。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE dispute_decision (&#10;  decision_id      BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  case_id          BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  outcome          VARCHAR(20) NOT NULL,   -- REFUND_FULL|RETURN_REFUND|&#10;                                           -- PARTIAL_COMPENSATE|PAY_SELLER&#10;  amount_minor     BIGINT      NOT NULL,   -- 裁决金额，记账币种&#10;  accounting_ccy   CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  buyer_ccy        CHAR(3)     NOT NULL,&#10;  fx_rate_used     NUMERIC(20,10),&#10;  fx_rate_source   VARCHAR(24),            -- 汇率来源与时刻，供申诉复核&#10;  fx_locked_at     TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  rule_version     VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,&#10;  reason_code      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  funding_party    VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,   -- PLATFORM|SELLER|CARRIER&#10;  created_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  CONSTRAINT ck_outcome CHECK (outcome IN&#10;    (&#39;REFUND_FULL&#39;,&#39;RETURN_REFUND&#39;,&#39;PARTIAL_COMPENSATE&#39;,&#39;PAY_SELLER&#39;))&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> dispute_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  case_id          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  outcome          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- REFUND_FULL|RETURN_REFUND|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                                           -- PARTIAL_COMPENSATE|PAY_SELLER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount_minor     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 裁决金额，记账币种</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accounting_ccy   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  buyer_ccy        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fx_rate_used     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fx_rate_source   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),            </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 汇率来源与时刻，供申诉复核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fx_locked_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  funding_party    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PLATFORM|SELLER|CARRIER</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ck_outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (outcome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUND_FULL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RETURN_REFUND'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PARTIAL_COMPENSATE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PAY_SELLER'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fx_rate_used</code>、<code>fx_rate_source</code>、<code>fx_locked_at</code> 三个字段看似繁琐，但它们是申诉时的必需品：买家收到的是本地币种，其金额取决于平台在哪个时刻锁定汇率。没有这三项，同一裁决会被质疑&quot;为什么别人退得比我多&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"资金动作与执行主体\">资金动作与执行主体</h2><p>裁决的出口决定<strong>谁承担</strong>，资金执行决定<strong>谁垫付</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>出口</th>\n<th>常见垫付方</th>\n<th>承担方</th>\n<th>执行方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REFUND_FULL</td>\n<td>平台先行赔付</td>\n<td>视责任：卖家/承运商/平台</td>\n<td>买家即时到账，后向责任方追偿</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RETURN_REFUND</td>\n<td>卖家（验收后）</td>\n<td>卖家</td>\n<td>验收通过后释放退款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PARTIAL_COMPENSATE</td>\n<td>平台或卖家</td>\n<td>视责任比例</td>\n<td>一次性结算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PAY_SELLER</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>买家</td>\n<td>冻结资金释放给卖家</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>平台先行赔付</strong>是一个重要的产品决策：它把买家的等待时间从&quot;卖家响应时间&quot;缩短到&quot;平台处理时间&quot;，代价是平台承担了追偿成本与坏账。多数平台对小金额案件采用先行赔付，对大金额案件要求先行确认卖家责任——分界线与自动裁决的金额上限通常是同一个数量级，因为两者本质上都在回答&quot;这笔钱值不值得花人力去精确归责&quot;。</p>\n<p>资金动作必须与保证金的扣划解耦：裁决只发出&quot;卖家应承担 X&quot;的指令，实际扣划由结算系统在下个结算周期执行。把两者耦合会造成一个危险后果——当卖家保证金不足时，裁决被阻塞，买家无限等待。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决定树的可解释性与版本管理\">决定树的可解释性与版本管理</h2><p>决定树是<strong>规则资产</strong>，必须有版本、有变更记录、有回放能力。三个具体工程要求：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，每条规则的输出必须可追溯。</strong> 裁决记录里保存 <code>rule_version</code> 与 <code>reason_code</code>，且 <code>reason_code</code> 是受控枚举，不是自由文本。质检与一致性分析（见 <a href=\"../appeal-consistency/decision-consistency-precedent\">裁决一致性与判例库</a>）依赖它对案件分组。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，规则变更必须支持影子运行。</strong> 新版本的规则在正式启用前，应能对最近的历史案件做离线重放，输出&quot;新旧版本的判定差异率&quot;。差异率高但无法解释的变更不应上线——它通常意味着规则里引入了未声明的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，规则变更不能追溯已结案件。</strong> 除非变更是为了纠正系统性错误（此时应有明确的批量重审程序与通知机制）。静默追溯会让所有历史裁决失去确定性，进而摧毁申诉机制的可信度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>裁决收敛为四条出口：REFUND_FULL、RETURN_REFUND、PARTIAL_COMPENSATE、PAY_SELLER；决定树的价值在于同输入同输出，而非比人更准。</li>\n<li>REFUND_FULL 的核心理由是&quot;货不可回或回不划算&quot;，低值跨境商品默认走这条；RETURN_REFUND 的退款触发点必须绑定&quot;验收通过&quot;而非&quot;买家声称已寄出&quot;。</li>\n<li>PARTIAL_COMPENSATE 只适用于可量化的部分损失且退货不经济；绝不用作&quot;证据不足时的息事宁人&quot;，否则决定树变成可套利机器。</li>\n<li>部分补偿金额由可观测损失项推导并设上限：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\min(P \\cdot d,\\; P - \\max(F_{return}, V_{salvage}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>跨境案件必须显式记录汇率来源与锁定时刻，否则同类裁决的到账金额无法解释。</li>\n<li>资金动作与保证金扣划解耦：裁决只发指令，扣划由结算周期执行，避免保证金不足阻塞买家赔付。</li>\n<li>决定树是带版本的规则资产，须支持影子运行与差异率审查，且不得静默追溯已结案件——一致性机制见 <a href=\"../appeal-consistency/decision-consistency-precedent\">裁决一致性与判例库</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"退款/退货/补偿/打款决定树","id":"退款-退货-补偿-打款决定树"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四条出口的触发条件","id":"四条出口的触发条件"},{"level":3,"text":"REFUND_FULL：货不可回或回不划算","id":"refund_full-货不可回或回不划算"},{"level":3,"text":"RETURN_REFUND：货有价值且可回","id":"return_refund-货有价值且可回"},{"level":3,"text":"PARTIAL_COMPENSATE：双方都不全对","id":"partial_compensate-双方都不全对"},{"level":3,"text":"PAY_SELLER：主张不成立","id":"pay_seller-主张不成立"},{"level":2,"text":"决定树中的金额计算","id":"决定树中的金额计算"},{"level":3,"text":"部分补偿的量化","id":"部分补偿的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"货币与汇率的口径","id":"货币与汇率的口径"},{"level":2,"text":"资金动作与执行主体","id":"资金动作与执行主体"},{"level":2,"text":"决定树的可解释性与版本管理","id":"决定树的可解释性与版本管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"小额自动裁决与人工复核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/evidence-adjudication/auto-smallclaim-manual-review"},"next":{"title":"买卖双方双向申诉流程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-online-dispute-resolution/appeal-consistency/buyer-seller-appeal-bilateral"}}